New Zealand’s North Island so unique.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:31.160
Photographer Erika Larsen ventured to Te Puia, 

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:35.120
a centre for Māori culture and 
geothermal wonders, to explore.

