a guide that can translate and introduce,

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:17.760
and allow you to feel the landscape so, 
so your job here is really important.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:19.040
It is. 

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:22.600
In my family there's four generations who have all guided,

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:27.760
we have become kaitiaki or guardians, of all the areas, 

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:33.880
so it’s our responsibility to take care of our whenua, 
to take care of our land.

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:39.680
When I’m walking along this pathway here, 
I’m walking along the same path as my ancestors

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:44.640
and when the guided visitors through the 
area here it’s just something that came naturally.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:48.080
So the knowledge is… it’s natural knowledge. 

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:49.640
It’s here, you know it by living it.

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:50.640
It’s here, you know it by living it.
- It is.

