By just experiencing it and living it. It’s beautiful.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:53.840
It’s so beautiful.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:55.080
It’s so beautiful.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:58.960
For me, there are so many moments in the world 
that are so loud 

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:01.520
and you come here and you can feel...

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:02.520
Yeah.

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:04.560
You can feel a little more human. 

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:05.920
Yeah, exactly right. 

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:07.560
