I can feel it, I can touch it."

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.200
They do go away, leaving here at Te Puia 
as part as my whānau, 

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.320
as part as my family, because that’s who I am.

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:34.920
