Do you remember a moment where you’ve felt okay, 
I started to have a connection here?

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:25.960
It’s when you realise that sound is everything.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:26.680
Sound? 

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:27.360
Yes.

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:30.080
